<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept base="Anywhere" id="t00551">
	<title>Leading Vehicle Departure Alert</title>
	<conbody>
		<table frame="none" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="formatc_none">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1" outputclass="FormatA">
				<colspec colnum="1" colname="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colnum="2" colname="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="0">
						<entry colname="1" colsep="0">
							<fig>
								<figgroup>
									<image href="../../images/N_TK25Z019_E.eps" align="center" placement="break" height="1.573in" width="2.243in"/>
								</figgroup>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="2">
							<ol outputclass="callout">
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol outputclass="a1804409">Driver assistance</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol outputclass="a1804462">DAW (Driver Attention Warning)</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
								<li>
									<p> <uicontrol outputclass="a1804462">Leading Vehicle departure Alert</uicontrol> </p>
								</li>
							</ol>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>With the vehicle on, select <menucascade><uicontrol>Setup</uicontrol><uicontrol>Vehicle</uicontrol><uicontrol>Driver assistance</uicontrol><uicontrol>DAW (Driver Attention Warning)</uicontrol><uicontrol>Leading vehicle departure alert</uicontrol></menucascade> on the infotainment system.</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<p> <uicontrol>Leading vehicle departure alert</uicontrol>: Driver Attention Warning will inform the driver when a detected vehicle in front departs from a stop.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
</concept>